> The account-index path issues the detail fetch through the **home-cell client** (`runAuthenticatedActivityAPI`). `fetchTrailDescription` uses `trailsBasePath` (`/api/v1/trails/...`), which the home cell only serves for repos it hosts. If the detail fetch fails for a cross-cell repo it degrades to the list body with a warning (existing best-effort behavior) — acceptable for v1; note cross-cell detail as a follow-up.

